---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Kvisl" description="Kvisl is an independent, member-run nonprofit devoted to sustained thought and exploration.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span></p>
    <h1 class="page-title">To attend<br />is to inhabit.</h1>
    <p class="page-lede"><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> is an independent, member-run nonprofit. We make room for sustained attention rather than fragmented noise, and for understanding rather than speed.</p>
    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>Attention is more than looking. It is a way of entering a subject deeply enough to let it alter how the world is understood.</p>
      <p><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> publishes long-form writing, research, visual narratives, and carefully edited work across philosophy, science, nature, society, culture, and art. The common requirement is simple: the question should be worth staying with.</p>
      <p>Our editorial and technical choices are designed around the same principle. The aim is not to maximize traffic, but to give serious thought enough time and space to exist.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
